    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000s711](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000s711) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 27.125 depth occurred on Feb 06 2026 60km E of Tepa. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.7516 longitude 130.1235. It impacted 8573 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
